EPIC-260715-3810we_tcp-dns-system-vpn/STORY-260715-2bfjhn_dns-and-ip-routing/TASK-260715-5o6jqg_implement-ssh-dns-over-tcp-upstream/README.md:4:Implement the M1 DNS upstream transport that opens bounded SSH direct-tcpip channels to the resolver selected by the approved policy, writes and reads RFC-compatible TCP length-prefixed DNS messages, validates correlation and size, and returns explicit failure without any physical resolver fallback.
